&lt;p&gt;I have a love-hate relationship with BART. I’m grateful for it, but let’s just say it’s not always the most reliable so it&amp;rsquo;s nice to see before hand when the train you need is due to arrive. There are plenty of projects out there that show real-time BART arrival information. This one does that too, it’s nothing groundbreaking, but I wanted to build my own version that captures the vintage BART platform sign vibe I associate with commuting between the East Bay and my job in the city.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>